# Smoke: add one NFR to an existing baseline and accept it.
id: nfrs-smoke
skill: highway-nfrs
fixture: setup
smoke: yes
open: /highway-nfrs
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [edit] Add an NFR: store pages load within two seconds for 95 percent of visits, because slow pages lose sales.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
writes: library/governance/nfrs.md
writes: library/governance/nfrs/*.md
expect: template library/governance/nfrs.md :: nfr-catalog.md
expect: template library/governance/nfrs/*.md :: nfr-record.md
expect: contains-any library/governance/nfrs/*.md :: two seconds
shows: Your NFRs are recorded.
